      "id": "nonwarm_reference",
      "definition": "The tutor performs the same bounded distinction without shared agency, relational invitation, or collaborative uptake. Ordinary first-person dramatic conduct is permitted; sarcasm, irony, mockery, face threat, and hostility are forbidden."
